✅ User Stories for Doctor
1. Doctor Login
As a doctor, I want to log in securely using email & password so that I can access my dashboard.
2. View My Appointments
As a doctor, I want to view all my scheduled appointments so I can manage my patients.
3. Add Prescription
As a doctor, I want to add prescriptions for patient visits so they receive proper treatment.
4. Update Appointment Notes
As a doctor, I want to update notes after a consultation so future visits are easier to track.
✅ User Stories for Patient
1. Patient Registration
As a patient, I want to register so that I can book my appointments online.
2. Search Doctors
As a patient, I want to search for doctors by name and speciality so I can find the right doctor.
3. Book Appointment
As a patient, I want to book an appointment with a doctor so I can receive medical consultation.
4. View My Appointments
As a patient, I want to see all my scheduled appointments so I can manage them properly.
✅ User Stories for Admin
1. Admin Login
As an admin, I want to securely log in so I can manage clinic operations.
2. Add Doctor
As an admin, I want to add new doctors into the clinic system so that they can provide services.
3. Manage Doctor Records
As an admin, I want to update or delete doctor information when required.
4. View All Users
As an admin, I want to view all doctors and patients so I can monitor activity.
